  "story": {
    "title": "A Bed for Grumble",
    "bgm": "b2_u4_story",
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": "scene_b2_u04_1",
        "desc": "Dusk at the Word Pond, the sky orange and purple. Grumble has tried to sneak across the stepping stones with his lantern, slipped, and now sits on a stone holding his hind leg, which is swollen big and wrapped in a hastily tied red cloth, his face scrunched in pain, lantern tipped beside him still glowing. Bun and Hedgie hurry over the stones toward him; Pip flutters above saying a word backwards with a worried face; Beads peeks from a lily pad. Hidden in the picture: Grumble's big leg, the red cloth.",
        "hidden": [
          "leg",
          "red"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "narrator",
            "text": "Grumble has a big leg!",
            "audio": "b2_u04_l1",
            "ko": "그럼블 다리가 퉁퉁 부었어요!"
          },
          {
            "who": "grumble",
            "text": "Shh... Ouch! My leg!",
            "audio": "b2_u04_l2",
            "ko": "쉿… 아야! 내 다리!"
          },
          {
            "who": "pip",
            "text": "Deb! Deb?",
            "audio": "b2_u04_l3",
            "ko": "뎁! 뎁?"
          }
        ],
        "video": "vid_b2_u04_1",
        "ko": "해질녘, 그럼블이 돌에서 미끄러졌어요. 다리가 퉁퉁 부었어요. 핍은 \"뎁!\"",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "What happened to Grumble?",
            "ko": "그럼블에게 무슨 일이 생겼어?"
          },
          {
            "en": "Is it morning or evening?",
            "ko": "지금은 아침이야, 저녁이야?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b2_u04_2",
        "desc": "On the bank, Bun and Hedgie have built a little bed out of soft reeds with a red blanket and a white pillow. Beads threads b-e-d and a row of new stepping stones rises so they can carry Grumble to the bank; Bun and Hedgie tuck Grumble into the bed, his bandaged leg propped up on a cushion, his nightcap askew, his lantern on a stump beside the bed glowing warmly. Pip pats his paw. Hidden in the picture: the bed, the red blanket.",
        "hidden": [
          "bed",
          "red"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "beads",
            "text": "/b/ /e/ /d/ bed!",
            "audio": "blend_bed",
            "pop": "bed",
            "ko": "/b/ /e/ /d/ 침대!"
          },
          {
            "who": "bun",
            "text": "A little bed! A red bed!",
            "audio": "b2_u04_l4",
            "ko": "작은 침대! 빨간 침대!"
          },
          {
            "who": "hedgie",
            "text": "Grumble is in the bed.",
            "audio": "b2_u04_l5",
            "ko": "그럼블이 침대에 누웠어요."
          }
        ],
        "ko": "갈대로 빨간 침대를 만들었어요. 비즈가 b-e-d 를 꿰고, 그럼블을 침대에 눕혀요.",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "What color is the bed?",
            "ko": "침대는 무슨 색이야?"
          },
          {
            "en": "Who is in the bed?",
            "ko": "침대에 누가 누웠어?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b2_u04_3",
        "desc": "Night by the bed, lit by Grumble's lantern. Hedgie feeds Grumble soup with a spoon from a bowl; a small brown puppy sits up on its back legs beside the bed, paws together, begging for a bite; Grumble's wet striped nightcap hangs on a washing line between two reeds, held by a wooden clothes peg. Beads threads l-e-g on the lantern stump; Bun yawns. Grumble's grumpy face has softened into a shy smile. Hidden in the picture: the puppy eating from a bowl after being fed, the begging puppy, the peg.",
        "hidden": [
          "fed",
          "beg",
          "peg"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "narrator",
            "text": "Hedgie fed Grumble.",
            "audio": "b2_u04_l6",
            "ko": "헤지가 그럼블에게 먹여 줬어요."
          },
          {
            "who": "beads",
            "text": "/l/ /e/ /g/ leg!",
            "audio": "blend_leg",
            "pop": "leg",
            "ko": "/l/ /e/ /g/ 다리!"
          },
          {
            "who": "grumble",
            "text": "Shh... Thank you.",
            "audio": "b2_u04_l7",
            "ko": "쉿… 고마워."
          }
        ],
        "video": "vid_b2_u04_2",
        "ko": "헤지가 수프를 먹여 줘요. 강아지가 앞발을 들고 졸라요. 빨래집게에 그럼블 모자가 걸려 있어요.",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "What does Hedgie do?",
            "ko": "헤지가 뭘 해?"
          },
          {
            "en": "What is the puppy doing?",
            "ko": "강아지는 뭘 해?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b2_u04_4",
        "desc": "Morning. Grumble stands on the bank next to the little red bed, his leg thin again and only a small bandage left, holding the bed's pillow to his chest and looking at the friends hopefully; Bun and Hedgie laugh; the puppy still begs beside the bed; the peg and the dry nightcap hang on the line; the stepping stones sparkle in the sun. Pip hops on the bed's end. Hidden in the picture: the bed, the peg, the begging puppy.",
        "hidden": [
          "bed",
          "peg",
          "beg"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "bun",
            "text": "The big leg is little!",
            "audio": "b2_u04_l8",
            "ko": "퉁퉁 부은 다리가 작아졌어!"
          },
          {
            "who": "grumble",
            "text": "Shh... It is my bed?",
            "audio": "b2_u04_l9",
            "ko": "쉿… 이거 내 침대야?"
          },
          {
            "who": "hedgie",
            "text": "Yes! A bed for Grumble.",
            "audio": "b2_u04_l10",
            "ko": "응! 그럼블의 침대야."
          }
        ],
        "ko": "아침이에요. 다리가 다 나았어요! 그럼블이 베개를 안고 \"내 침대야?\" 해요.",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "Is the leg big now?",
            "ko": "다리가 아직 부었어?"
          },
          {
            "en": "What does Grumble hug?",
            "ko": "그럼블이 뭘 안고 있어?"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "synopsis_ko": "그럼블이 몰래 돌을 건너다 미끄러져 다리를 다쳤어요. 친구들이 빨간 침대를 만들어 눕히고 수프를 먹여 줬어요. 아침에 다리가 나은 그럼블이 \"이거 내 침대야?\" 하고 물어요.",
    "so_far_ko": "암탉 열 마리를 건너게 했어요. 핍이 \"넷\"을 바로 말했어요.",
    "goal_ko": "다친 그럼블을 돌보며 -ed·-eg 단어를 읽어요."
  },
